  "description": "Prosecutor Seo-Jun decides to overturn the set pattern and seize the power he had been ignoring for a while after his friend's demotion, whom he thought would only walk on a flowery path. While he was brainstorming strategies with his friend who calls himself a whistleblower, he starts receiving unknown text messages from the future...\n\nA fierce battle to seize the initiative in power and Seo-Jun's confident rise to fame after obtaining the text messages from the future!\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
